BenchSeed

This product includes software developed by the tpchgen-rs project:
https://github.com/clflushopt/tpchgen-rs

The initial source snapshot was imported from upstream commit
7e64184d25648ffa8db4575bc683a24d23f60297 under the Apache License, Version
2.0. The original project was developed by clflushopt, alamb, and other
contributors listed in the upstream repository.

This derivative is independently maintained and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the upstream maintainers or the Transaction Processing Performance
Council (TPC).

The derivative was renamed to BenchSeed. Package, crate, binary, workflow, and
documentation identifiers were updated to use the BenchSeed brand.

BenchSeed also restricts CSV delimiters to the table-safe set proposed in
upstream issue #381:
https://github.com/clflushopt/tpchgen-rs/issues/381
